# REVIEWED: 9d2288ad3669e88f
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:90
msgid "\\11. How are results percentages calculated?"
msgstr "\\11. ¿Cómo se calculan los porcentajes de los resultados?"

# REVIEWED: 35298b50dc67cf80
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:91
msgid ""
"The results percentage is the :iati-"
"reference:`result/indicator/period/actual/@value`, expressed as a percentage"
" from the :iati-reference:`result/indicator/baseline/@value` to the :iati-"
"reference:`result/indicator/period/target`."
msgstr ""
"El porcentaje de resultados es el :iati-"
"reference:`result/indicator/period/actual/@value`, expresado como porcentaje"
" del :iati-reference:`result/indicator/baseline/@value` respecto a :iati-"
"reference:`result/indicator/period/target`."

# REVIEWED: 1eb5cfaa1daa0494
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:94
msgid ""
"It is clamped from 0 to 100. If the target or actual value is less than the "
"baseline value, the percentage will be 0%."
msgstr ""
"Está restringido de 0 a 100. Si el valor objetivo o real es inferior al "
"valor de referencia, el porcentaje será 0%."

# REVIEWED: 257df9553b77d063
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:97
msgid ""
"For example, a result could have baseline of 10, a target of 100, and an "
"actual value of 50."
msgstr ""
"Por ejemplo, un resultado podría tener un valor de referencia de 10, un "
"objetivo de 100 y un valor real de 50."

# REVIEWED: 310bb3d929966683
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:99
msgid "The baseline to target value change is: ``100 - 10 = 90``"
msgstr "El cambio del valor de referencia al objetivo es: ``100 - 10 = 90``"

# REVIEWED: 4dd5b6f4e71d3838
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:100
msgid "The baseline to actual value change is: ``50 - 10 = 40``"
msgstr "El cambio del valor de referencia al real es: ``50 - 10 = 40``"

# REVIEWED: c3a4c05b6809dfdc
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:101
msgid "The results percentage is therefore: ``40/90 x 100 = 44%``"
msgstr "El porcentaje del resultado es, por tanto: ``40/90 x 100 = 44%``"
